Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Synopsys DesignWare (referenced, NOT distributed)

  The RTL instantiates the following DesignWare components by name, through
  project-authored wrappers under rtl/common_ip/bf16_arithmatic_ip/sim/ and
  rtl/common_ip/sram/:

    DW_fp_add, DW_fp_sub, DW_fp_mult, DW_fp_div, DW_fp_addsub, DW_fp_cmp,
    DW_fp_sqrt, DW_fp_exp, DW_fp_exp2, DW_fp_sincos, DW_fp_i2flt,
    DW_ram_r_w_s_dff, DW01_add

  The DesignWare libraries themselves are licensed by Synopsys and are not
  distributed with this repository; the integrator supplies them. The functional
  stand-ins under rtl/common_ip/bf16_arithmatic_ip/sim/ are project-authored and
  contain no Synopsys source.

